            <p data-id="t-sebastian-q0" data-name="Quote" style={{ position: 'relative', flex: '0 0 auto', order: '0', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#2A2E33', fontSize: '17px', lineHeight: '1.6' }}>Whenever someone asks me about UX Design, I always show them the workflow Donji made for turning user feedback into potential features. The way he organizes features is really the best example of effective UX planning. For Kickback.chat, the app we worked on together, he made it extremely clear what the priorities were for what to build next in order to maximize the user experience for the end user. I couldn’t recommend him more!</p>
